<title>USA: Sudbury continues to evaluate options.</title>
<headline>Sudbury continues to evaluate options.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sudbury Inc said on Tuesday that is is evaluating an $170 million merger offer from Park-Ohio Industries Inc and it will continue to explore a number of avenues to boost shareholder value.</p>
<p>The company expects preliminary indications of interest from other potential bidders on September 6, 1996.</p>
<p>No decision has been made that a transaction with any company is necessarily in the best interests of Sudbury stockholders, the company said.</p>
<p>Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc has been assisting the company with its opportunities to boost shareholder value, Sudbury said.</p>
</text>
